  75-82   F8.4   mas/yr  e_pmRA    Gaia DR3 proper-motion uncertainty in right ascension
  84-91   F8.4   mas/yr  pmDE      Corrected proper motion in declination
  93-100  F8.4   mas/yr  e_pmDE    Gaia DR3 proper-motion uncertainty in declination
