 120-127  F8.4   mag     RPmag     Gaia DR3 GRP magnitude
 129-136  F8.4   mag     Jmag      2MASS J magnitude
 138-145  F8.4   mag     Hmag      2MASS H magnitude
 147-154  F8.4   mag     Ksmag     2MASS Ks magnitude
 156-162  F7.4   ---     Fidelity  Rybizki et al. astrometric fidelity v2
 164-170  F7.4   ---     pHDBSCAN  Native HDBSCAN membership probability for the selected branch
 172-178  F7.4   ---     pFreq     Fraction of HDBSCAN sweeps in which the source was recovered
 180-186  F7.4   ---     pMember   Composite membership pseudo-probability pHDBSCAN*pFreq
 188      I1     ---     Ref       Reference-sample flag: 1 if pMember >= 0.6 after clipping
 190-196  F7.4   ---     PMSProb   Sagitta PMS probability when available
 198-204  F7.4   mag     AvSag     Sagitta visual extinction estimate when available
 206-213  F8.4   log(yr) logAgeSag Sagitta logarithmic age estimate when available
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Notes:
  Ref=1 identifies the 254-source reference sample with pMember>=0.6 after
  parallax-mode sigma clipping. Ref=0 rows are retained likely candidates
  with 0.5<pMember<0.6.
  PMSProb, AvSag, and logAgeSag are Sagitta outputs when available and are
  not used as HDBSCAN clustering coordinates.

Acknowledgements:
  This table uses Gaia DR3 and 2MASS data products.
